{"id":"ce4fe6d93660be43","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world.md","title":"Meloni’s Reflexive Canonical GL World","display":"ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world — Meloni’s Reflexive Canonical GL World","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world","aliases":["89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world — Meloni’s Reflexive Canonical GL World","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]","[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world — Meloni’s Reflexive Canonical GL World"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\\)</span> 是元层标准算术真值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}\\)</span> 为逆良基性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma_\\tau\\)</span> 是下文从真实算术实现引入的公式集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma_\\tau\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\land\\Gamma_\\tau R_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\Gamma_\\tau,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{CWF}_{W_{\\mathrm{GL}}}(R_{\\mathrm{GL}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma_\\tau\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\land\\Gamma_\\tau R_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\Gamma_\\tau,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{CWF}_{W_{\\mathrm{GL}}}(R_{\\mathrm{GL}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 90–91；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma_\\tau\\)</span> 有有限 GL 反驳，GL 的算术可靠性和 PA 的标准可靠性使一个所有合取项均真的合取的否定为真，矛盾。翻译保否定，因此对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 恰选取一个极性，集合极大一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau\\)</span>，标准证明谓词的真实性给 PA 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(A)\">\\(\\tau(A)\\)</span> 的有限证明，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau\">\\(A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau\\)</span>，这正是典范自环关系。单元素集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Gamma_\\tau\\}\">\\(\\{\\Gamma_\\tau\\}\\)</span> 没有无后继成员，反驳逆良基性。这展示模型固定赋值验证 GL 与框架任意赋值验证 GL 的差异。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_\\tau&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A)\\},\\\\\n&\\Gamma_\\tau\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\land\\Gamma_\\tau R_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\Gamma_\\tau,\\\\\n&\\neg\\mathrm{CWF}_{W_{\\mathrm{GL}}}(R_{\\mathrm{GL}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Gamma_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\Gamma_\\tau\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1962,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"收敛：[[89-df-modal-iteration]] → [[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]] → [[89-df-convergent-frame]] → [[89-thm-canonical-convergence]] → [[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]。边界：[[89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive]]、[[89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world]]。"}],"outgoing":["6f068c38418e21f2","1f581262c09d5e34","0ce064881a79d6f7","ab8391d7623da45d","ae4d761acfb9353d"]}